<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>Solve each inequality. Choose the sign and type the number.</p><p>(a) <m>5x - 5 \lt 3x - 1</m></p><div><m>x</m> [ &lt; | ≤ | &gt; | ≥ ] <fillin characters="5" name="ans2"/>  </div><p>(b) <m>4 - 7x \lt 18</m></p><div><m>x</m> [ &lt; | ≤ | &gt; | ≥ ] <fillin characters="5" name="ans4"/>  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>(a) Subtract <m>{3}x</m> from both sides: <m>{2x - 5} {\lt} {-1}</m>. Add <m>{5}</m> on both sides: <m>{2x} {\lt} {4}</m>. Divide both sides by <m>{2}</m>, a positive number, so the sign stays the same: <m>x \lt 2</m>. Check with <m>x = {1}</m>: the left side is <m>{0}</m> and the right side is <m>{2}</m>, and the statement is true.</p><p>(b) Method 1: subtract <m>{4}</m> from both sides: <m>{-7x} {\lt} {14}</m>. Divide both sides by <m>{-7}</m>. Dividing by a negative number turns the sign round: <m>x \gt -2</m>.</p><p>Method 2: add <m>{7x}</m> to both sides so that no negative number is involved: <m>{4} {\lt} {18 + 7x}</m>. Subtract <m>{18}</m> from both sides: <m>{-14} {\lt} {7x}</m>, so <m>{-2} {\lt} x</m>, which is the same as <m>x \gt -2</m>.</p><p>Check with <m>x = {-1}</m>: the left side is <m>{11}</m>, and <m>{11} {\lt} {18}</m> is true.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p>&lt;</p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>2</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p>&gt;</p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>-2</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>